.TH MYSTRLEN 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils" "Library Functions"

.SH NAME
mystrlen \- calculate the length of a string

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.B int mystrlen(const char *s);

.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrlen
function calculates the number of characters in the string pointed to by
.BR s ,
not including the terminating null character.

